---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy - Get Yo Frozen Yogurt"
  description="Privacy Policy for Get Yo mobile application and website - Learn how we protect your data"
>
  <main>
    <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-50 via-white to-pink-50 py-12">
      <div class="container mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4">
        <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-6 shadow-xl md:p-8">
          <div class="mb-8">
            <a
              href="/"
              class="mb-6 inline-flex items-center text-primary-dark transition-colors hover:text-orange-600"
            >
              <i class="ri-arrow-left-line mr-2"></i>
              Back to Home
            </a>
            <div class="text-center">
              <h1 class="mb-4 text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 md:text-4xl">
                Privacy Policy
              </h1>
              <p class="text-lg text-gray-600">
                Last Updated: January 15, 2025
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="prose max-w-none space-y-8">
            <section>
              <h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">
                Introduction
              </h2>
              <p class="leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
                Welcome to Get Yo Frozen Yogurt ("Get Yo," "we," "our," or
                "us"). We're committed to protecting your privacy and being
                transparent about how we handle your information. This Privacy
                Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your data when
                you use our mobile app, websites (frozenyogurtcafe.com), and
                related services.
              </p>
              <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
                By using our services, you're agreeing to this Privacy Policy.
                If you don't agree with how we handle data, please don't use our
                services.
              </p>
            </section>

            <section>
              <h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">
                Information We Collect
              </h2>

              <h3 class="mb-3 mt-6 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800">
                Personal Information You Provide
              </h3>
              <p class="mb-3 leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
                When you create an account or interact with our services, we may
                collect:
              </p>
              <ul class="ml-4 list-inside list-disc space-y-2 text-gray-700">
                <li>
                  <strong>Account Details:</strong> Your name, email address, and
                  encrypted password
                </li>
                <li>
                  <strong>Profile Info:</strong> Profile picture, date of birth (optional),
                  phone number (optional)
                </li>
                <li>
                  <strong>Sign-In Data:</strong> If you use Google or Apple Sign-In,
                  we receive basic info from them
                </li>
                <li>
                  <strong>Your Feedback:</strong> Reviews, flavor suggestions, messages,
                  and comments you send us
                </li>
                <li>
                  <strong>Rewards Info (Optional):</strong> If you choose to join
                  our Ounce&Bounce rewards program, we collect related account information
                  through RewardUp.io
                </li>
              </ul>

              <h3 class="mb-3 mt-6 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800">
                How You Use Our Services
              </h3>
              <ul class="ml-4 list-inside list-disc space-y-2 text-gray-700">
                <li>
                  <strong>Your Preferences:</strong> Favorite flavors, toppings, store
                  location choices
                </li>
                <li>
                  <strong>Voting Activity:</strong> Which flavors you vote for and
                  any custom suggestions
                </li>
                <li>
                  <strong>Reviews & Ratings:</strong> What you post and rate
                </li>
                <li>
                  <strong>Notification Settings:</strong> Your choices about push
                  notifications
                </li>
              </ul>

              <h3 class="mb-3 mt-6 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800">
                Technical Information
              </h3>
              <p class="mb-2 leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
                Like most apps, we automatically collect some technical data:
              </p>
              <ul class="ml-4 list-inside list-disc space-y-2 text-gray-700">
                <li>
                  <strong>Device Info:</strong> Your device type, operating system,
                  and identifiers
                </li>
                <li>
                  <strong>Usage Patterns:</strong> Which features you use, how long
                  you spend in the app
                </li>
                <li>
                  <strong>General Location:</strong> City/state level location to
                  show you the right store info
                </li>
                <li>
                  <strong>Technical Logs:</strong> IP address, browser type, timestamps,
                  crash reports
                </li>
                <li>
                  <strong>Push Tokens:</strong> Device tokens needed to send notifications
                  (via Expo)
                </li>
              </ul>

              <h3 class="mb-3 mt-6 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800">
                What We Don't Collect
              </h3>
              <ul class="ml-4 list-inside list-disc space-y-2 text-gray-700">
                <li>
                  Payment information (we don't handle payments - everything
                  happens in-store)
                </li>
                <li>Biometric data (Face ID/Touch ID stays on your device)</li>
                <li>Precise GPS coordinates</li>
                <li>Health or medical information</li>
                <li>Social Security Numbers or government IDs</li>
              </ul>
            </section>

            <section>
              <h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">
                How We Use Your Information
              </h2>
              <p class="mb-3 leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
                We use your information to:
              </p>
              <ul class="ml-4 list-inside list-disc space-y-2 text-gray-700">
                <li>
                  <strong>Run the App:</strong> Provide core features, display menus,
                  show store hours
                </li>
                <li>
                  <strong>Personalize Your Experience:</strong> Remember your favorite
                  flavors and make recommendations
                </li>
                <li>
                  <strong>Send Notifications:</strong> Alert you about new flavors,
                  voted flavors that arrive, and special offers (only if you opt in)
                </li>
                <li>
                  <strong>Help You Out:</strong> Respond to your questions and feedback
                </li>
                <li>
                  <strong>Improve Our Offerings:</strong> Analyze voting patterns
                  to decide which new flavors to introduce
                </li>
                <li>
                  <strong>Manage Rewards:</strong> Handle your Ounce&Bounce points
                  through RewardUp.io (if you join)
                </li>
                <li>
                  <strong>Make Things Better:</strong> Understand how people use the
                  app so we can improve it
                </li>
                <li>
                  <strong>Keep You Informed:</strong> Send important updates about
                  service changes or policies
                </li>
                <li>
                  <strong>Stay Safe:</strong> Detect and prevent fraud or security
                  issues
                </li>
                <li>
                  <strong>Follow the Law:</strong> Comply with legal requirements
                  when necessary
                </li>
              </ul>
            </section>

            <section>
              <h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">
                Third-Party Services We Use
              </h2>
              <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
                We work with trusted partners to run our app. Each has their own
                privacy policy:
              </p>

              <div class="ml-4 space-y-4">
                <div
                  class="rounded-lg border-l-4 border-blue-500 bg-gray-50 p-4"
                >
                  <h3 class="mb-1 font-semibold text-gray-800">Supabase</h3>
                  <p class="mb-2 text-sm text-gray-700">
                    Handles our database, authentication, and app content. They
                    encrypt everything.
                  </p>
                  <a
                    href="https://supabase.com/privacy"
                    target="_blank"
                    rel="noopener noreferrer"
                    class="text-sm text-primary-dark underline hover:text-orange-600"
                  >
                    View Supabase Privacy Policy →
                  </a>
                </div>

                <div
                  class="rounded-lg border-l-4 border-red-500 bg-gray-50 p-4"
                >
                  <h3 class="mb-1 font-semibold text-gray-800">
                    Google Sign-In
                  </h3>
                  <p class="mb-2 text-sm text-gray-700">
                    If you sign in with Google, they share your basic info with
                    us (name, email, profile pic).
                  </p>
                  <a
                    href="https://policies.google.com/privacy"
                    target="_blank"
                    rel="noopener noreferrer"
                    class="text-sm text-primary-dark underline hover:text-orange-600"
                  >
                    View Google Privacy Policy →
                  </a>
                </div>

                <div
                  class="rounded-lg border-l-4 border-gray-800 bg-gray-50 p-4"
                >
                  <h3 class="mb-1 font-semibold text-gray-800">
                    Apple Sign-In
                  </h3>
                  <p class="mb-2 text-sm text-gray-700">
                    If you sign in with Apple, they might give you a private
                    relay email to protect your identity.
                  </p>
                  <a
                    href="https://www.apple.com/legal/privacy/"
                    target="_blank"
                    rel="noopener noreferrer"
                    class="text-sm text-primary-dark underline hover:text-orange-600"
                  >
                    View Apple Privacy Policy →
                  </a>
                </div>

                <div
                  class="rounded-lg border-l-4 border-purple-500 bg-gray-50 p-4"
                >
                  <h3 class="mb-1 font-semibold text-gray-800">
                    Expo Push Notifications
                  </h3>
                  <p class="mb-2 text-sm text-gray-700">
                    Delivers push notifications to your phone. We only send what
                    you've opted into.
                  </p>
                  <a
                    href="https://expo.dev/privacy"
                    target="_blank"
                    rel="noopener noreferrer"
                    class="text-sm text-primary-dark underline hover:text-orange-600"
                  >
                    View Expo Privacy Policy →
                  </a>
                </div>

                <div
                  class="rounded-lg border-l-4 border-green-500 bg-gray-50 p-4"
                >
                  <h3 class="mb-1 font-semibold text-gray-800">
                    Ounce&Bounce Rewards (RewardUp.io) - Optional
                  </h3>
                  <p class="mb-2 text-sm text-gray-700">
                    Our loyalty rewards program. Completely optional to join. If
                    you do sign up, RewardUp.io manages your account and has
                    their own privacy policy.
                  </p>
                  <a
                    href="https://get-yo.member.rewardup.io"
                    target="_blank"
                    rel="noopener noreferrer"
                    class="text-sm text-primary-dark underline hover:text-orange-600"
                  >
                    Visit Rewards Program →
                  </a>
                </div>
              </div>

              <p class="mt-4 text-sm italic leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
                Note: We're not responsible for how these third parties handle
                your data. We encourage you to read their privacy policies.
              </p>
            </section>

            <section>
              <h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">
                Sharing Your Information
              </h2>
              <p class="mb-3 font-semibold leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
                We don't sell your personal information. Period.
              </p>
              <p class="mb-3 leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
                We may share your information in these limited situations:
              </p>
              <ul class="ml-4 list-inside list-disc space-y-2 text-gray-700">
                <li>
                  <strong>With Your Permission:</strong> When you explicitly agree
                  (like making your reviews public)
                </li>
                <li>
                  <strong>Service Providers:</strong> With companies that help us
                  run the app (listed above)
                </li>
                <li>
                  <strong>Public Posts:</strong> Reviews and ratings are visible to
                  others unless you make your profile private
                </li>
                <li>
                  <strong>Legal Requirements:</strong> If required by law or court
                  order
                </li>
                <li>
                  <strong>Safety:</strong> To protect our rights or the safety of
                  users
                </li>
                <li>
                  <strong>Business Changes:</strong> If we're acquired or merge with
                  another company (we'd notify you)
                </li>
                <li>
                  <strong>Anonymous Data:</strong> We might share aggregated statistics
                  that can't identify you
                </li>
              </ul>
            </section>

            <section>
              <h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">
                Data Security
              </h2>
              <p class="mb-3 leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
                We take security seriously and use industry-standard measures:
              </p>
              <ul class="ml-4 list-inside list-disc space-y-2 text-gray-700">
                <li>
                  <strong>Encryption:</strong> All data between your device and our
                  servers is encrypted
                </li>
                <li>
                  <strong>Password Protection:</strong> Your passwords are hashed
                  with bcrypt - we never see your actual password
                </li>
                <li>
                  <strong>Limited Access:</strong> Only necessary team members can
                  access user data
                </li>
                <li>
                  <strong>Regular Reviews:</strong> We periodically check for security
                  vulnerabilities
                </li>
                <li>
                  <strong>Secure Storage:</strong> Data is stored with enterprise-grade
                  cloud providers
                </li>
              </ul>
              <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
                That said, no internet transmission is 100% secure. While we do
                our best to protect your information, we can't guarantee
                absolute security.
              </p>
              <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
                <strong>If Something Goes Wrong:</strong> In the unlikely event of
                a data breach, we'll notify affected users as required by law.
              </p>
            </section>

            <section>
              <h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">
                How Long We Keep Your Data
              </h2>
              <p class="mb-3 leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
                We keep your information only as long as needed:
              </p>
              <ul class="ml-4 list-inside list-disc space-y-2 text-gray-700">
                <li>
                  <strong>Active Accounts:</strong> While you're using the app
                </li>
                <li>
                  <strong>After Deletion:</strong> We aim to permanently delete your
                  data within 30 days of account deletion
                </li>
                <li>
                  <strong>Anonymous Data:</strong> Some data might be kept in anonymized
                  form for analytics
                </li>
                <li>
                  <strong>Legal Requirements:</strong> Sometimes we need to keep certain
                  information longer for legal or fraud prevention reasons
                </li>
              </ul>
              <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
                <strong>When you delete your account:</strong>
              </p>
              <ul
                class="ml-4 list-inside list-disc space-y-1 text-sm text-gray-700"
              >
                <li>
                  Your profile, email, and personal info are removed from the
                  Get Yo app
                </li>
                <li>Your favorites and votes are deleted</li>
                <li>
                  Your reviews might stay up as "Former User" to keep ratings
                  fair
                </li>
                <li>Backups are cleared within 30 days</li>
              </ul>
              <div
                class="mt-4 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-purple-500 bg-purple-50 p-4"
              >
                <p class="mb-2 text-sm font-semibold text-purple-900">
                  <i class="ri-alert-line mr-1"></i>
                  Important: Rewards Program
                </p>
                <p class="text-sm text-purple-900">
                  If you joined the Ounce&Bounce rewards program, deleting your
                  Get Yo app account doesn't automatically delete your rewards
                  account. You'll need to separately delete that at <a
                    href="https://get-yo.member.rewardup.io"
                    target="_blank"
                    rel="noopener noreferrer"
                    class="font-semibold text-primary-dark underline hover:text-orange-600"
                    >get-yo.member.rewardup.io</a
                  > or by emailing <a
                    href="mailto:support@rewardup.io"
                    class="text-primary-dark underline hover:text-orange-600"
                    >support@rewardup.io</a
                  >.
                </p>
              </div>
            </section>

            <section>
              <h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">
                Your Privacy Rights
              </h2>
              <p class="mb-3 leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
                You have control over your personal information:
              </p>

              <div class="ml-4 space-y-3">
                <div>
                  <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-800">Access Your Data</h3>
                  <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">
                    Request a copy of the information we have about you
                  </p>
                </div>

                <div>
                  <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-800">Correct Your Info</h3>
                  <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">
                    Update your information in the app's profile settings
                  </p>
                </div>

                <div>
                  <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-800">
                    Delete Your Account
                  </h3>
                  <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">
                    Remove your account from profile settings or email us. <a
                      href="/account-deletion"
                      class="text-primary-dark underline hover:text-orange-600"
                      >Learn more</a
                    >
                  </p>
                  <p class="mt-1 text-xs italic text-gray-700">
                    Note: Rewards account requires separate deletion at
                    RewardUp.io
                  </p>
                </div>

                <div>
                  <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-800">Get Your Data</h3>
                  <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">
                    Request your data in a portable format
                  </p>
                </div>

                <div>
                  <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-800">
                    Opt Out of Notifications
                  </h3>
                  <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">
                    Turn off push notifications in your device or app settings
                  </p>
                </div>

                <div>
                  <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-800">
                    Control Your Reviews
                  </h3>
                  <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">
                    Choose whether your reviews are public in profile settings
                  </p>
                </div>

                <div>
                  <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-800">
                    Object to Processing
                  </h3>
                  <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">
                    Ask us to stop processing your data for certain purposes
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
                To exercise these rights, email us at <a
                  href="mailto:privacy@getyocafe.com"
                  class="font-semibold text-primary underline hover:text-orange-600"
                  >privacy@getyocafe.com</a
                >. We'll respond within 30 days.
              </p>
            </section>

            <section>
              <h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">
                Push Notifications
              </h2>
              <p class="mb-3 leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
                We only send push notifications if you opt in. You control what
                you receive:
              </p>
              <ul class="ml-4 list-inside list-disc space-y-2 text-gray-700">
                <li>
                  <strong>New Flavors:</strong> When new flavors arrive at your store
                </li>
                <li>
                  <strong>Your Votes:</strong> When a flavor you voted for becomes
                  available
                </li>
                <li>
                  <strong>Special Offers:</strong> Exclusive deals and promotions
                </li>
              </ul>
              <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
                <strong>Want to opt out?</strong> Just turn off notifications in your
                device settings or app preferences anytime. The rest of the app works
                fine without them.
              </p>
            </section>

            <section>
              <h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">
                Children's Privacy
              </h2>
              <p class="leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
                Our app isn't designed for kids under 13, and we don't knowingly
                collect their information without parental consent.
              </p>
              <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
                If you're a parent and think your child under 13 has created an
                account, please email us immediately at <a
                  href="mailto:privacy@getyocafe.com"
                  class="text-primary-dark underline hover:text-orange-600"
                  >privacy@getyocafe.com</a
                >. We'll delete their information right away.
              </p>
              <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
                <strong>For Teens (13-17):</strong> If you're between 13 and 17, please
                get your parent's permission before using the app.
              </p>
            </section>

            <section>
              <h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">
                California Privacy Rights (CCPA/CPRA)
              </h2>
              <p class="mb-3 leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
                If you're in California, you have additional rights:
              </p>
              <ul class="ml-4 list-inside list-disc space-y-2 text-gray-700">
                <li>
                  <strong>Know:</strong> What information we collect and how we use
                  it
                </li>
                <li>
                  <strong>Delete:</strong> Request deletion of your information
                </li>
                <li>
                  <strong>Opt-Out:</strong> Say no to selling or sharing your info
                  (which we don't do anyway)
                </li>
                <li><strong>Correct:</strong> Fix inaccurate information</li>
                <li>
                  <strong>Limit:</strong> Restrict how we use sensitive information
                </li>
                <li>
                  <strong>No Discrimination:</strong> We won't treat you differently
                  for exercising these rights
                </li>
              </ul>
              <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
                To use these rights, email <a
                  href="mailto:privacy@getyocafe.com"
                  class="text-primary-dark underline hover:text-orange-600"
                  >privacy@getyocafe.com</a
                > with "California Privacy Rights" in the subject line.
              </p>
            </section>

            <section>
              <h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">
                European Union Privacy Rights (GDPR)
              </h2>
              <p class="mb-3 leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
                If you're in the EU, UK, or Switzerland, you have these rights
                under GDPR:
              </p>
              <ul class="ml-4 list-inside list-disc space-y-2 text-gray-700">
                <li>
                  <strong>Access:</strong> Get a copy of your personal data
                </li>
                <li>
                  <strong>Rectification:</strong> Correct inaccurate information
                </li>
                <li>
                  <strong>Erasure:</strong> Request deletion (the "right to be forgotten")
                </li>
                <li>
                  <strong>Restriction:</strong> Limit how we use your data
                </li>
                <li>
                  <strong>Portability:</strong> Get your data in a transferable format
                </li>
                <li>
                  <strong>Object:</strong> Say no to certain types of processing
                </li>
                <li>
                  <strong>Withdraw Consent:</strong> Change your mind about data processing
                </li>
                <li>
                  <strong>Complain:</strong> File a complaint with your local data
                  protection authority
                </li>
              </ul>
              <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
                <strong>Why we process your data:</strong>
              </p>
              <ul
                class="ml-4 list-inside list-disc space-y-1 text-sm text-gray-700"
              >
                <li>Your consent (like for notifications)</li>
                <li>To provide our services (contract performance)</li>
                <li>
                  Legitimate interests (improving the app, preventing fraud)
                </li>
                <li>Legal obligations</li>
              </ul>
            </section>

            <section>
              <h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">
                International Data Transfers
              </h2>
              <p class="leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
                Get Yo operates from the United States, so your data might be
                transferred and stored here or wherever our service providers
                operate. Different countries have different privacy laws.
              </p>
              <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
                By using our app, you understand your data might be transferred
                internationally. We take steps to protect it, including:
              </p>
              <ul
                class="ml-4 mt-2 list-inside list-disc space-y-1 text-sm text-gray-700"
              >
                <li>
                  Using EU-approved Standard Contractual Clauses when needed
                </li>
                <li>
                  Making sure our partners have proper data protection measures
                </li>
                <li>Following GDPR requirements for international transfers</li>
              </ul>
            </section>

            <section>
              <h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">
                Cookies and Tracking
              </h2>
              <p class="mb-3 leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
                Our website uses cookies:
              </p>
              <ul class="ml-4 list-inside list-disc space-y-2 text-gray-700">
                <li>
                  <strong>Essential Cookies:</strong> Needed for the site to work
                </li>
                <li>
                  <strong>Analytics:</strong> Help us understand how people use the
                  site
                </li>
                <li><strong>Preferences:</strong> Remember your settings</li>
              </ul>
              <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
                <strong>The Mobile App:</strong> Doesn't use browser cookies but might
                use local storage on your device to save preferences.
              </p>
              <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
                <strong>Do Not Track:</strong> Our services don't currently respond
                to Do Not Track signals, but you can control cookies through your
                browser settings.
              </p>
            </section>

            <section>
              <h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">
                Changes to This Policy
              </h2>
              <p class="leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
                We might update this Privacy Policy occasionally. When we make
                significant changes, we'll:
              </p>
              <ul
                class="ml-4 mt-2 list-inside list-disc space-y-1 text-gray-700"
              >
